          <p><strong>Disabling cookies.</strong> You can typically remove or reject cookies via your browser settings. In order to do this, follow the instructions provided by your browser (usually located within the &ldquo;settings,&rdquo; &ldquo;help,&rdquo; &ldquo;tools,&rdquo; or &ldquo;edit&rdquo; facility). Many browsers are set to accept cookies until you change your settings.</p>
          <p>If you do not accept our cookies, you may experience some inconvenience in your use of our Website. For example, we may not be able to recognize your device and you may need to log in every time you visit our Website.</p>
